WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.537
Mei: Hi! I'm Mei. I'm fifteen and I live in Manchester. My favourite celebration is Lunar New Year.

2
00:00:08.537 --> 00:00:12.333
Mei: It usually takes place in late January or February.

3
00:00:12.483 --> 00:00:18.542
Mei: A few days before, we clean the whole flat to sweep away bad luck.

4
00:00:18.542 --> 00:00:20.593
Mei: My brother hates that part!

5
00:00:20.743 --> 00:00:25.969
Mei: On New Year's Eve, my grandparents come from Liverpool and we have a huge reunion dinner.

6
00:00:25.969 --> 00:00:30.212
Mei: We make dumplings together, all of us around the kitchen table.

7
00:00:30.362 --> 00:00:39.178
Mei: For me, that's the best moment. Everybody is talking and laughing, and nobody is looking at their phone.

8
00:00:39.328 --> 00:00:44.938
Mei: Then the children get red envelopes with money, and we go to Chinatown to watch the dragon dance.

9
00:00:44.938 --> 00:00:47.596
Mei: It's so loud and colourful!

10
00:00:47.746 --> 00:00:50.661
Mei: Not every family celebrates it in the same way.

11
00:00:50.661 --> 00:00:56.013
Mei: But for us, it's about being together and starting the year with good luck.
